# FastAPI API (M8+)

- Keep API thin: delegate to `src/ai_doc/rag/`.
- Required routes: `GET /health`, `POST /chat` (context + query or document ref).
- Expose OpenAPI at `/docs`; use Pydantic models for request/response.
- No Streamlit imports in `src/ai_doc/api/`.
- Reuse prompts from `configs/prompts.yaml`; do not duplicate prompt text in routes.
- Auth (M10) belongs in middleware or proxy, not hardcoded keys in source.

PRs and reviews follow the standard in `AGENTS.md`.
